@* A mail template: subject, body and variables. A variable button writes its token at the caret of the subject or of the body;
   the Preview tab shows the mail rendered by OmniMailRenderer with the sample values, in the colours of the theme, as a mail
   client will receive it. Insert a block adds a banner or an action button to the file link; Expected documents is a block
   variable. Send a test hands the rendered mail to the application, which would send it: this example sends nothing and
   only says what it received. *@
<OmniMailTemplateEditor Id="editor-mail"
                        @bind-Value="MailBody"
                        @bind-Subject="MailSubject"
                        Variables="MailVariables"
                        Theme="MailTheme"
                        Label="Reminder mail template"
                        Rows="8"
                        OnSendTest="SendMailTest" />
<p id="editor-mail-test" aria-live="polite">@MailTestNotice</p>
